                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "136ffbdc-9161-3e2e-93dd-12eba639d8d0",
                        "entry_id": "f3b75e42-2cf5-31d1-bebe-b835751ceb2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "рег. дом, угол, жилище"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c55b88e-b5e0-4eb1-9550-06f1469c0c13",
                                "sense_id": "136ffbdc-9161-3e2e-93dd-12eba639d8d0",
                                "text": "Он задавал вопросы, касающиеся поведения и внешности незнакомца, потом стал интересоваться соседями. ― Есть тут одно кубло, ― пояснил Данилов. ― Зинка Скудева с сыном."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf20a776-c6c1-3b58-86e0-c68266af9919",
                        "entry_id": "f3b75e42-2cf5-31d1-bebe-b835751ceb2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кубан. запущенное человеческое жилье"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "460f0554-6ad5-332b-82db-c8ee0cb1f8ab",
                        "entry_id": "f3b75e42-2cf5-31d1-bebe-b835751ceb2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "рег. птичье гнездо, звериное логово"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "205e186d-b782-419b-8de9-139d78e150e3",
                                "sense_id": "460f0554-6ad5-332b-82db-c8ee0cb1f8ab",
                                "text": "В общем, раскрыли кубло, как говорят в народе, то есть звериное логово."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d7e86bbe-58c5-3a09-9233-585200e996e4",
                        "entry_id": "f3b75e42-2cf5-31d1-bebe-b835751ceb2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кубан. разгульная сомнительная компания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f38cd57-1c54-4aab-813e-2f4e28114feb",
                                "sense_id": "d7e86bbe-58c5-3a09-9233-585200e996e4",
                                "text": "Здесь тайно собиралось то самое кубло, которое академик Рядно искал и не мог найти, и они смотрели какой-то запретный научный фильм."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "506213b9-b4ea-441f-b580-79755ca012ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "f3b75e42-2cf5-31d1-bebe-b835751ceb2b",
                        "target_lang_word": "clan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "clan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac0d1e47-b45e-3a95-9635-d9c8db65217a",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of people all descended from a common ancestor, in fact or belief, especially when the exact genealogies are not known."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f2a3d6c-015c-3326-bf58-718ceef4582d",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traditional social group of families in the Scottish Highlands having a common hereditary chieftain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2f703e3-7dce-372a-a4bd-4657eefce79e",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any group defined by family ties with some sort of political unity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9cb25a1-c4da-42ce-8a7f-9d162a4f8983",
                                                "sense_id": "e2f703e3-7dce-372a-a4bd-4657eefce79e",
                                                "text": "As a rule, you see, I'm not lugged into Family Rows. On the occasions when Aunt is calling to Aunt like mastodons bellowing across primeval swamps and Uncle James's letter about Cousin Mabel's peculiar behaviour is being shot round the family circle... the clan has a tendency to ignore me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a0675f8-0e18-371c-ae1a-22a5edb041aa",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of players who habitually play on the same team in multiplayer games."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1ef193a-b17b-3880-b6b1-88af6620830e",
                                        "entry_id": "4f4ba1cb-fe6e-39f2-9354-04e2b3628792",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A badger colony."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
